{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-currency-recurring","title":"多币种周期扣费与汇率锁定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/subscription-recurring-commerce/recurring-billing/multi-currency-recurring","wordCount":2106,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"多币种周期扣费与汇率锁定\">多币种周期扣费与汇率锁定</h1><p>月付订阅在汇率上有一个一次性订单没有的性质：<strong>它每一期都在重新经历一次跨境结算，而买家看到的数字几乎不变</strong>。这让汇率处理从「一笔交易的成本问题」变成「一个持续数年的口径问题」——今天定下的一版汇率策略，会在未来三十几期里每一次都被复用，任何一行含糊都会在第三年变成一笔无法解释的汇兑差异。</p>\n<p>本文只处理币种与汇率，不重复第 1 篇的幂等机制与第 3 篇的渠道细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个独立的币种口径\">核心概念：三个独立的币种口径</h2><p>跨境订阅里同时存在三种「币种」，混用会直接导致财务报表错位。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>谁关心</th>\n<th>变更时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定价币 <code>price_currency</code></td>\n<td>计划在该市场的报价币种</td>\n<td>买家、运营</td>\n<td>调价时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算币 <code>settlement_currency</code></td>\n<td>平台账户实际收款币种</td>\n<td>财务、渠道</td>\n<td>签约时确定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记账币 <code>ledger_currency</code></td>\n<td>内部账本与报表的币种</td>\n<td>财务、税务</td>\n<td>公司政策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>买家在德国看到 €9.49，渠道可能以 EUR 结算到平台欧元账户，而集团记账用 USD——三种币种之间的换算点必须在系统里显式标注。<strong>最重要的决策是：换算发生在账单生成的那一刻，而不是在报表生成的那一刻。</strong> 如果只存定价币金额、在报表时按当期汇率换算，那么同一张历史账单在每个月会被换算成不同金额，历史报表随之每月变动，这在审计中不可接受。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Plan PriceBook&lt;br/&gt;market=DE: 949 EUR] --&gt; B[账单生成时刻]&#10;    B --&gt; C[冻结 rate_snapshot_id&lt;br/&gt;+ fx_rate_used]&#10;    C --&gt; D[账单: 定价币 949 EUR&lt;br/&gt;记账币 1026 USD]&#10;    D --&gt; E[渠道扣款 949 EUR]&#10;    E --&gt; F[结算入账 EUR&lt;br/&gt;platform fee 抽成]&#10;    F --&gt; G[日终对账&lt;br/&gt;比对渠道结算金额]&#10;    G --&gt; H[汇兑差异分录&lt;br/&gt;fx_gain_loss]\">graph TD\n    A[Plan PriceBook&lt;br/&gt;market=DE: 949 EUR] --&gt; B[账单生成时刻]\n    B --&gt; C[冻结 rate_snapshot_id&lt;br/&gt;+ fx_rate_used]\n    C --&gt; D[账单: 定价币 949 EUR&lt;br/&gt;记账币 1026 USD]\n    D --&gt; E[渠道扣款 949 EUR]\n    E --&gt; F[结算入账 EUR&lt;br/&gt;platform fee 抽成]\n    F --&gt; G[日终对账&lt;br/&gt;比对渠道结算金额]\n    G --&gt; H[汇兑差异分录&lt;br/&gt;fx_gain_loss]</pre><h2 id=\"汇率锁定-锁什么-锁多久\">汇率锁定：锁什么、锁多久</h2><p>「锁定汇率」这句话在实践中至少有四种解释，必须在订阅对象上选择其一并写清楚。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>锁定对象</th>\n<th>买家体感</th>\n<th>平台汇率风险</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不换算（本地定价）</td>\n<td>无需锁</td>\n<td>价格恒定</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有本地价目表的成熟市场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按订阅锁定</td>\n<td>订阅创建时的汇率</td>\n<td>全程金额恒定</td>\n<td>全程由平台承担</td>\n<td>长期合约、B2B</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按周期锁定</td>\n<td>每期生成账单时的汇率</td>\n<td>每期金额可能微变</td>\n<td>仅承担单期</td>\n<td>多数跨境 SaaS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按记价表锁定</td>\n<td>汇率档位（如 ±2% 内同价）</td>\n<td>长期稳定</td>\n<td>档内自担</td>\n<td>定价敏感品类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>按订阅锁定</strong>看似对买家最友好，实际风险最大：一份三年期订阅会把三年内的汇率波动全部压在平台一侧，且无法在合理范围内调价（调价即违约），因此它只适合金额小、周期短或可对冲的场景。<strong>按周期锁定</strong>是多数产品的实际选择，但它必须解决一个衍生问题：如果每期金额都随汇率微变，买家会看到「同样的服务，这个月 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9.10</mn><mtext>，下个月</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9.10，下个月</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9.10</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，下个月</span></span></span></span></span>9.13」，这既难解释也可能触发部分市场的「价格变更需提前通知」要求。</p>\n<p>实用解法是<strong>记价表档位</strong>：预先定义一组价格档位（例如以基准价 ±2%、±5% 为界），只有当汇率变动使换算价跨出当前档位时才调整报价。这样买家的价格在多数周期内保持不变，平台承担档内的微小波动，调价频率从「每期」降到「每季度或半年」。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>band</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>rate</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>rate</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mi>δ</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>price</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>band</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>rate</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{band}(\\text{rate}) = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{\\text{rate} - r_0}{\\delta} \\right\\rfloor, \\quad \\text{price} = P_0 \\cdot \\bigl(1 + k\\,\\text{band}(\\text{rate})\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">band</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">price</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">band</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"税费-随周期重算-不随订阅冻结\">税费：随周期重算，不随订阅冻结</h2><p>比汇率更容易被忽略的是<strong>税率会变</strong>。数字服务的增值税/GST 税率由买家所在地决定，而所在地可能变（搬迁）、税率可能变（各国财政年度调整）、以及买家的税务身份可能变（个人转为 B2B 并要求逆向征收）。主流渠道正是按「每期按当时买家所在地重算」实现的：Stripe Tax 在每张账单生成时依据该客户的税务所在地与商品的税代码自动计算税额，且明示「更新客户地址会影响今后发票的税额与总额」（来源：Stripe, Collect taxes for recurring payments, <a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/billing/taxes/collect-taxes\">https://docs.stripe.com/billing/taxes/collect-taxes</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>是否随订阅冻结</th>\n<th>变化时的处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>税率</td>\n<td><strong>否</strong>，每期按当时税率重算</td>\n<td>账单行分别记录税率与税基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家所在地（税务地址）</td>\n<td>否，每期按账单地址重新判定</td>\n<td>需要地址变更时的通知机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家税务身份（B2B/B2C）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>需存储税号并做格式校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格（含税/不含税）</td>\n<td>是，锁定计划版本</td>\n<td>含税定价时税额从价格中拆出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率档位</td>\n<td>是，随报价档位</td>\n<td>见上节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>含税定价（tax-inclusive）与不含税定价（tax-exclusive）的差异在周期制下被放大。若采用含税定价，买家看到 €9.49 就永远付 €9.49，税率上升时平台的税后收入自动减少；若采用不含税定价，买家付的金额随税率浮动，必须在扣费前明确展示。多数面向消费者的跨境订阅采用<strong>含税定价</strong>，代价是平台吸收税率变动——这个选择必须在账单对象上留下痕迹（<code>pricing_mode</code> 字段），否则无法在事后解释「为什么这个市场每期实收不同」。这一开关在渠道上是商品/价格级的显式属性：Stripe 用 <code>tax_behavior</code> 声明价格的金额是已含税（<code>inclusive</code>）还是需另加（<code>exclusive</code>）（来源：Stripe, Products and prices, <a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/products-prices/how-products-and-prices-work\">https://docs.stripe.com/products-prices/how-products-and-prices-work</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"function build_invoice(sub, cycle):&#10;  plan   = plan_version(sub.plan_version_id)          # 冻结的价格&#10;  market = resolve_market(sub.tax_address, cycle.charge_at)&#10;  tax    = tax_engine.calculate(market, plan.price_ex, plan.category)&#10;  rate   = fx_service.rate(plan.price_currency, ledger_currency, cycle.charge_at)&#10;  return invoice(&#10;    price_currency      = plan.price_currency,&#10;    price_amount        = plan.price,&#10;    pricing_mode        = plan.tax_inclusive ? &quot;inclusive&quot; : &quot;exclusive&quot;,&#10;    tax_lines           = tax.lines,                  # 每期重算&#10;    ledger_currency     = ledger_currency,&#10;    ledger_amount       = round(plan.price * rate),&#10;    fx_rate_used        = rate,&#10;  )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function build_invoice(sub, cycle):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  plan   = plan_version(sub.plan_version_id)          # 冻结的价格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  market = resolve_market(sub.tax_address, cycle.charge_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tax    = tax_engine.calculate(market, plan.price_ex, plan.category)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rate   = fx_service.rate(plan.price_currency, ledger_currency, cycle.charge_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return invoice(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    price_currency      = plan.price_currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    price_amount        = plan.price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pricing_mode        = plan.tax_inclusive ? \"inclusive\" : \"exclusive\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tax_lines           = tax.lines,                  # 每期重算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ledger_currency     = ledger_currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ledger_amount       = round(plan.price * rate),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fx_rate_used        = rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"汇兑差异与对账\">汇兑差异与对账</h2><p>即使每一期都在生成时冻结了汇率，平台仍然会面对「账单记账金额」与「渠道结算金额」之间的差异，因为渠道的结算汇率、结算时间与抽成规则都会进一步改变实际到账数。这些差异必须被显式记录为<strong>汇兑损益</strong>（fx gain/loss），而不是被吸收进某个「其他费用」科目。这一处理方式与成熟账务系统的科目设计一致：Stripe 的收入确认模块把账单开具到收款之间因汇率变动产生的差额单独归入 <code>FxLoss</code> 科目，并把「结算币」（settlement currency，即银行账户使用的币种）与展示币种分开处理（来源：Stripe, Revenue Recognition methodology, <a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/revenue-recognition/methodology\">https://docs.stripe.com/revenue-recognition/methodology</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异来源</th>\n<th>产生位置</th>\n<th>记录方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>入账汇率与结算汇率不同</td>\n<td>渠道结算</td>\n<td>汇兑损益分录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道抽成与跨境费</td>\n<td>结算明细</td>\n<td>手续费分录（不是汇兑）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款时的汇率已变</td>\n<td>退款（见第三章/第四章）</td>\n<td>按退款日汇率，差额入汇兑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>舍入</td>\n<td>每次换算</td>\n<td>单列舍入行，不混入其他</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里有一条硬纪律：<strong>不要让舍入差异在链路里静默消失</strong>。每一处换算（定价币→记账币、记账币→结算币、退款时的反向换算）都会产生最小单位的舍入，若允许它们散落在各层被丢弃，一年后会累积成一笔无法归因的挂账。做法是每次换算都产生一条显式的舍入记录，并在日终把同一币种的舍入总额作为一行独立分录，使「所有分录加总 = 银行流水」这条等式恒成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>区分<strong>定价币 / 结算币 / 记账币</strong>三个口径，并在账单上同时记录定价金额与记账金额。</li>\n<li>汇率在<strong>账单生成时刻冻结</strong>，绝不延迟到报表阶段换算，否则历史报表每月变动。</li>\n<li>锁汇策略选一：小型短期可用按订阅锁，主流做法是<strong>按周期锁 + 记价表档位</strong>，把调价频率降到季度级。</li>\n<li><strong>税率与税务地址随周期重算</strong>，价格随计划版本冻结；含税定价需在账单上标注 <code>pricing_mode</code>。</li>\n<li>汇兑差异、手续费、舍入必须<strong>分科目显式记录</strong>，保证「分录加总 = 银行流水」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文产出的 <code>price_amount</code>、<code>currency</code>、<code>fx_rate_used</code> 就是<a href=\"auto-renew-charge\">到期自动扣费与幂等</a>中账单对象的金额来源；扣款请求里 <code>amount</code> 与 <code>credential</code> 的关系、以及跨币种凭据的有效范围，见<a href=\"payment-token-reuse\">支付凭据复用与渠道续扣</a>。若某期扣费失败，三种句柄（订阅级、账单级、尝试级）在催缴流程中的使用顺序见<a href=\"../failed-payment/grace-pause-churn\">宽限、暂停与流失挽回</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多币种周期扣费与汇率锁定","id":"多币种周期扣费与汇率锁定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个独立的币种口径","id":"核心概念-三个独立的币种口径"},{"level":2,"text":"汇率锁定：锁什么、锁多久","id":"汇率锁定-锁什么-锁多久"},{"level":2,"text":"税费：随周期重算，不随订阅冻结","id":"税费-随周期重算-不随订阅冻结"},{"level":2,"text":"汇兑差异与对账","id":"汇兑差异与对账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"到期自动扣费与幂等","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/subscription-recurring-commerce/recurring-billing/auto-renew-charge"},"next":{"title":"支付凭据复用与渠道续扣","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/subscription-recurring-commerce/recurring-billing/payment-token-reuse"}}